# Wave W17-I (Mt. Millstone — Lower Halls): wet mill wall — wet dark bands in the cavewall idiom, drip-heavy: long drip streaks run down its own face from its own hanging points, the falls’ water always on its way down (design: torch-lit wet halls, falls sheeting down the rock). The Lower Halls’ own wall.
